cettes par d\u00e9faut.</Description><Description language-id="de_DE">Suchergebnisse mit einem standardm\u00e4\u00dfigen Facettenset anzeigen.</Description><Description language-id="hu_HU">Megjelen\u00edti a keres\u00e9si eredm\u00e9nyeket az alap\u00e9rtelmezett fazettak\u00e9szlettel.</Description><Description language-id="ja_JP">\u30d5\u30a1\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u306e\u65e2\u5b9a\u306e\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u3067\u691c\u7d22\u7d50\u679c\u3092\u8868\u793a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</Description><Description language-id="pt_BR">Exibir resultados de pesquisa com um conjunto de facetas padr\u00e3o.</Description><Description language-id="es_ES">Mostrar resultados de la b\u00fasqueda con un conjunto por defecto de facetas.</Description><Description language-id="sv_SE">Visa s\u00f6kresultat med en standardupps\u00e4ttning av fasetter.</Description></root>',NULL,NULL,'portlet','column-1=com_liferay_portal_search_web_search_bar_portlet_SearchBarPortlet_INSTANCE_4DCUTZzg4fcb,com_liferay_portal_search_web_suggestions_portlet_SuggestionsPortlet_INSTANCE_4DCUTZzg4fcb,\u000acolumn-2=com_liferay_portal_search_web_site_facet_portlet_SiteFacetPortlet_INSTANCE_4DCUTZzg4fcb,com_liferay_portal_search_web_type_facet_portlet_TypeFacetPortlet_INSTANCE_4DCUTZzg4fcb,com_liferay_portal_search_web_tag_facet_portlet_TagFacetPortlet_INSTANCE_4DCUTZzg4fcb,com_liferay_portal_search_web_category_facet_portlet_CategoryFacetPortlet_INSTANCE_4DCUTZzg4fcb,com_liferay_portal_search_web_folder_facet_portlet_FolderFacetPortlet_INSTANCE_4DCUTZzg4fcb,com_liferay_portal_search_web_user_facet_portlet_UserFacetPortlet_INSTANCE_4DCUTZzg4fcb,com_liferay_portal_search_web_modified_facet_portlet_ModifiedFacetPortlet_INSTANCE_4DCUTZzg4fcb,\u000acolumn-3=com_liferay_portal_search_web_search_results_portlet_SearchResultsPortlet_INSTANCE_4DCUTZzg4fcb,com_liferay_portal_search_web_search_options_portlet_SearchOptionsPortlet_INSTANCE_4DCUTZzg4fcb,\u000alast-merge-time=1739913662513\u000alayout-template-id=1_2_columns_i\u000ap